-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAll four harness entries `verified` in the table, plugin installs and one representative skill executes end-to-end on each, no unresolved token reaching a shell outside claude-code.\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"a25c67b6fe393c0e7df795196c8336cc8218242fe016587e13bfab004029f42e\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABUI3ydQ\"}"}